      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Williamsdale sits in the southern part of St. Clair Township, just north of the village of New Miami.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsdale%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The community lies in the valley of the Great Miami River, though the river itself does not touch the town’s limits.",
